1
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:36,110
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:41,110
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:41,110 --> 00:02:45,110
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:50,110
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:50,110 --> 00:02:53,110
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:56,110
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:59,110
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,110 --> 00:03:02,110
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:02,110 --> 00:03:05,110
Now this exciting!

10
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:08,110
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:12,110
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:17,110
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:23,110
Separated from the rest of his crew,

14
00:03:23,110 --> 00:03:27,110
Luffy has finally arrived at Marineford to rescue his brother Ace.

15
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:30,110
Fighting alongside Whitebeard and his associates,

16
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:33,110
he continues to push toward the scaffold.

17
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:35,110
Although Whitebeard himself is critically injured,

18
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,110
he entrusts Ace's future to Luffy,

19
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:42,110
who is aided by a team of pirates forging a path for him.

20
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:46,110
Stop and listen to me!

21
00:03:46,110 --> 00:03:47,110
What's wrong?

22
00:03:47,110 --> 00:03:49,110
There's a new plan!

23
00:03:49,110 --> 00:03:52,110
I'm either gonna live or I'm gonna die!

24
00:03:52,110 --> 00:03:56,110
So back up Straw Hat with everything you've got!

25
00:03:56,110 --> 00:04:02,110
They did it!

26
00:04:02,110 --> 00:04:04,110
They cleared a path!

27
00:04:04,110 --> 00:04:17,110
We did it!

28
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:18,110
I'm here!

29
00:04:18,110 --> 00:04:19,110
Grandpa!

30
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:32,110
Get out of the way!

31
00:04:32,110 --> 00:04:34,110
I'm not moving a damned inch!

32
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:37,110
I'm a Vice Admiral of the Navy!

33
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:42,110
I've been fighting pirates since long before you were born!

34
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:44,110
And I ain't stopping today!

35
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:45,110
Old man!

36
00:04:45,110 --> 00:04:47,110
You're not my grandson here!

37
00:04:47,110 --> 00:04:50,110
You are the pirate Straw Hat Luffy!

38
00:04:50,110 --> 00:04:52,110
And I'll fight you to the death!

39
00:04:55,110 --> 00:04:58,110
This is the path that you chose to take!

40
00:04:58,110 --> 00:05:01,110
You and your brother alike!

41
00:05:05,110 --> 00:05:07,110
Each on different paths!

42
00:05:07,110 --> 00:05:08,110
Luffy versus Garp!

43
00:05:20,110 --> 00:05:21,110
Come on!

44
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:22,110
Grandpa!

45
00:05:22,110 --> 00:05:23,110
Let me by!

46
00:05:23,110 --> 00:05:24,110
Please!

47
00:05:28,110 --> 00:05:29,110
Luffy!

48
00:05:32,110 --> 00:05:33,110
Luffy!

49
00:05:43,110 --> 00:05:44,110
Hey!

50
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:45,110
Kobe!

51
00:05:45,110 --> 00:05:46,110
Stay with me, little buddy!

52
00:05:46,110 --> 00:05:47,110
You'll make it!

53
00:05:53,110 --> 00:05:55,110
How could you do this to my friend?

54
00:05:55,110 --> 00:05:59,110
Kobe looked up to you, Straw Hat!

55
00:06:01,110 --> 00:06:02,110
I'll make you pay for this!

56
00:06:05,110 --> 00:06:06,110
I'm too weak.

57
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:10,110
I have to get stronger.

58
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,110
Kobe!

59
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:13,110
You're alive!

60
00:06:14,110 --> 00:06:15,110
Don't scare me!

61
00:06:19,110 --> 00:06:20,110
Where's Luffy?

62
00:06:20,110 --> 00:06:21,110
Who cares?

63
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:24,110
He ran off!

64
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:27,110
Wait!

65
00:06:27,110 --> 00:06:29,110
Garp is facing him right at the scaffold!

66
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:31,110
Are those two really gonna fight?

67
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:32,110
That's crazy!

68
00:06:33,110 --> 00:06:34,110
Luffy!

69
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:43,110
I can't believe nobody could stop that kid!

70
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:44,110
Damn it!

71
00:06:44,110 --> 00:06:45,110
Don't worry about it!

72
00:06:45,110 --> 00:06:46,110
It should be easy to hit him from here!

73
00:06:47,110 --> 00:06:48,110
Take aim!

74
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:49,110
And fire at will!

75
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:52,110
Impertinent boars!

76
00:06:52,110 --> 00:06:53,110
Stand back!

77
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:00,110
Taste my slave arrow!

78
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:04,110
You!

79
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:06,110
We almost had him!

80
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:08,110
Whose side are you on, anyway?

81
00:07:09,110 --> 00:07:10,110
Not yours, fool!

82
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:15,110
What if you had hit Vice Admiral Garp with a stray shot?

83
00:07:16,110 --> 00:07:17,110
Yeah, but...

84
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:19,110
I must protect him!

85
00:07:20,110 --> 00:07:24,110
Because Vice Admiral Garp is my beloved grandfather!

86
00:07:25,110 --> 00:07:26,110
Wait, that's not right!

87
00:07:26,110 --> 00:07:28,110
Yeah, that's news to me, too!

88
00:07:29,110 --> 00:07:31,110
Well, he will be if I ever marry Luffy!

89
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:34,110
And I'm sure I will someday!

90
00:07:35,110 --> 00:07:36,110
She's crazy!

91
00:07:37,110 --> 00:07:38,110
But cute!

92
00:07:43,110 --> 00:07:44,110
The bridge is gonna give out, straw boy!

93
00:07:45,110 --> 00:07:46,110
You gotta move it or lose it!

94
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:48,110
Whatever it takes!

95
00:07:49,110 --> 00:07:50,110
