128
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:55,250
Turns out, I'm not going to be a pirate.

129
00:09:55,510 --> 00:09:57,570
Now that's my boy, you finally get it.

130
00:09:57,910 --> 00:10:00,450
Uh-huh. I'll be way cooler than any pirate.

131
00:10:01,090 --> 00:10:02,590
I'll be king of the pirates!

132
00:10:07,090 --> 00:10:09,270
This is Shakes' influence, isn't it?

133
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,470
You're dismissed, ape.

134
00:10:12,470 --> 00:10:16,430
I'm going to teach you to be a proper marine if I have to beat it into you.

135
00:10:16,470 --> 00:10:17,690
Not this again!

136
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:23,870
The only way you will ever be a pirate is if I'm six feet under, boy!

137
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:48,490
You're all tuckered out, but I see your stomach's as lively as ever.

138
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:50,710
Or as noisy, at least.

139
00:10:50,710 --> 00:11:03,710
You probably don't care for me much, since I'm so loud and rough with you all the time.

140
00:11:04,250 --> 00:11:05,410
Can't blame you, really.

141
00:11:09,610 --> 00:11:11,930
But I'm not harsh, because I don't like you.

142
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:15,310
And I don't want you to be a Navy man for my sake, either.

143
00:11:15,310 --> 00:11:19,850
I just want you to have the strength to do the right thing and walk the right path.

144
00:11:21,850 --> 00:11:24,050
That's my one and only wish.

145
00:11:24,050 --> 00:11:39,830
By the way, I swiped some food from the Navy so you can eat all the meat you want for once.

146
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:44,070
I figure they owe me a favor and they'll probably think pirates stole it anyway.

147
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:46,670
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

148
00:11:48,250 --> 00:11:49,050
Grandpa...

149
00:11:49,050 --> 00:11:55,370
I'm not hurting you!

150
00:11:56,050 --> 00:11:57,050
Just move!

151
00:11:57,590 --> 00:12:00,610
If you don't strike me dead, then you'll lose Ace!

152
00:12:00,730 --> 00:12:01,790
Shut up!

153
00:12:01,890 --> 00:12:04,130
You can't just cry till you get your way!

154
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:05,830
I won't show you mercy!

155
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,450
You're a pirate, Luffy!

156
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:13,050
That makes you my enemy!

157
00:12:13,050 --> 00:12:13,550
Luffy!

158
00:12:40,050 --> 00:12:40,670
Luffy!

159
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:52,610
Luffy!

160
00:12:54,430 --> 00:12:54,770
Garb!

161
00:12:54,770 --> 00:13:24,750
Oh, my God.

162
00:13:24,770 --> 00:13:49,430
Damn it, this is all wrong. How the hell am I supposed to feel? Pops, Luffy, my friends. They could save me, but they're pushing through a sea of their own blood to do it. I'm sick. These are tears of joy. Even after all I've done, I want to live.

163
00:13:54,770 --> 00:14:00,590
He took down, Garp.

164
00:14:08,590 --> 00:14:09,950
Old man.

165
00:14:09,950 --> 00:14:17,570
They're family, after all. Damn it.

166
00:14:19,350 --> 00:14:23,610
Ah, look at that. I believe he just might make it.

167
00:14:23,970 --> 00:14:28,530
Hmm, change your mind. I thought you said he couldn't do it.

168
00:14:28,530 --> 00:14:34,630
I didn't say he could save Ace. Now that he's at the top, they'll die together. That's all.

169
00:14:34,890 --> 00:14:36,010
